.jd-cleared/.gitkeep — placeholder so the marker directory ships.
Run `!judgment-day` on staged ROZA-zone files, then:
  touch .jd-cleared/<path-with-slashes-as-underscores>
  # e.g. scripts/foo.ps1 -> .jd-cleared/scripts_foo.ps1

Markers are gitignored (`.jd-cleared/*`) — only `.gitkeep` is tracked.
